<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: '"Source Han Sans SC","Microsoft YaHei",Arial,sans-serif' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>test 只评一次：AUC 0.9546，落差 89% 来自分布</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#C7D8F2' }}>10 · Test &amp; Shift</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 22, paddingBottom: 54 }}>
        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40 }}>
            <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>0.9546</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>test AUC<br />624 张，仅此一次</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>0.8349</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>test ACC<br />阈值固定 0.5</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F', lineHeight: 1 }}>−0.1174</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>val ACC → test ACC<br />23 → 100 个假阳性</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ marginTop: 20, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 34 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 620, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16 }}>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Image src='assets/roc.png' style={{ width: 290, height: 265, objectFit: 'contain' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>test ROC</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Image src='assets/cm.png' style={{ width: 290, height: 265, objectFit: 'contain' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>test 混淆矩阵</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 506, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>落差拆解：先验只解释 11%</Text>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingBottom: 6, marginTop: 12 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568' }}>val 全量（阳性 74.2%）</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>0.9523</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingBottom: 6, marginTop: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568' }}>仅把先验对齐到 62.5%</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>0.9399 ± 0.0036</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingBottom: 6, marginTop: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568' }}>真实 test（阳性 62.5%）</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>0.8349</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 12 }}>
                    200 次自助抽样估计：先验变化只解释 <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>−0.0124（11%）</span>，<br />
                    剩下 <span style={{ color: '#D9534F', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>−0.1050（89%）</span> 是真实的分布偏移与阈值失配。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />

        <Box style={{ height: 52, background: '#E8EFF8', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 18, paddingRight: 18 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230' }}>
                按 test 先验回调阈值，最多只能挽回 1 个百分点——<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>它不是解法，只是把误差换个位置</span>。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 670, left: 60, width: 1160, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>MedMNIST 医学影像分类调参实验室 · 中期验收</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>10 / 15</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
